   "prompt": "<p>For the following exercises, determine whether the statement is true or false. Either prove it is true or find a counterexample if it is false.</p><p>If $f(x)$ is the antiderivative of $v(x),$ then $2f(x)$ is the antiderivative of $2v(x).$</p>",
